{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"api-reference","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Highlight is split into explicit entry points. Importing an entry point does not register languages or themes unless that entry point says it does."}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Entry point"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Purpose"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"default-entry","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ready-to-use highlighter with every bundled language"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"core","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/core"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Highlighter factory, renderers, and public types with no languages"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"markdown","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/markdown"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Code fence metadata and HAST helpers"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"remark","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/remark"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remark/MDAST integration"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"rehype","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/rehype"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rehype/HAST integration"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"react","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/react"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework-neutral data adapter for React components"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"octane","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/octane"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane component data and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@octanejs/mdx"},{"type":"text","value":" integration"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"theme","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/theme"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Theme types and CSS generation"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"languages","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/languages"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Aggregate exports for every bundled language"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"languages","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/languages/*"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Individually importable language definitions"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"themes","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/themes/*"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Individually importable themes"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use the "},{"type":"link","href":"default-entry","children":[{"type":"text","value":"default entry"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for convenience. Use "},{"type":"link","href":"core","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"core"}]},{"type":"text","value":" plus individual language modules when client bundle size matters."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"api-reference","text":"API Reference","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# API Reference\n\nTanStack Highlight is split into explicit entry points. Importing an entry point does not register languages or themes unless that entry point says it does.\n\n| Entry point | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight`](default-entry) | Ready-to-use highlighter with every bundled language |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/core`](core) | Highlighter factory, renderers, and public types with no languages |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/markdown`](markdown) | Code fence metadata and HAST helpers |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/remark`](remark) | Remark/MDAST integration |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/rehype`](rehype) | Rehype/HAST integration |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/react`](react) | Framework-neutral data adapter for React components |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/octane`](octane) | Octane component data and `@octanejs/mdx` integration |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/theme`](theme) | Theme types and CSS generation |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/languages`](languages) | Aggregate exports for every bundled language |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/languages/*`](languages) | Individually importable language definitions |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/themes/*`](themes) | Individually importable themes |\n\nUse the [default entry](default-entry) for convenience. Use [`core`](core) plus individual language modules when client bundle size matters.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: API Reference\n---\n\n# API Reference\n\nTanStack Highlight is split into explicit entry points. Importing an entry point does not register languages or themes unless that entry point says it does.\n\n| Entry point | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight`](default-entry) | Ready-to-use highlighter with every bundled language |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/core`](core) | Highlighter factory, renderers, and public types with no languages |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/markdown`](markdown) | Code fence metadata and HAST helpers |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/remark`](remark) | Remark/MDAST integration |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/rehype`](rehype) | Rehype/HAST integration |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/react`](react) | Framework-neutral data adapter for React components |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/octane`](octane) | Octane component data and `@octanejs/mdx` integration |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/theme`](theme) | Theme types and CSS generation |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/languages`](languages) | Aggregate exports for every bundled language |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/languages/*`](languages) | Individually importable language definitions |\n| [`@tanstack/highlight/themes/*`](themes) | Individually importable themes |\n\nUse the [default entry](default-entry) for convenience. Use [`core`](core) plus individual language modules when client bundle size matters.\n"}
